1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,055
These are said to be the last words of three missing lighthouse keepers.

2
00:00:04,304 --> 00:00:05,248
December 1900.

3
00:00:05,248 --> 00:00:09,766
Three keepers vanish from a lighthouse on a remote Scottish island.

4
00:00:10,016 --> 00:00:12,756
The relief keeper finds the station empty.

5
00:00:12,756 --> 00:00:14,452
Only one coat left behind.

6
00:00:14,702 --> 00:00:16,667
And that famous final log entry?

7
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:18,632
It isn't in the official record.

8
00:00:18,632 --> 00:00:20,228
It surfaced decades later.

9
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:23,217
The real clue was down at the west landing.

10
00:00:23,217 --> 00:00:24,109
Bent railings.

11
00:00:24,109 --> 00:00:25,065
A broken crane.

12
00:00:25,315 --> 00:00:27,179
The legend made it a ghost story.

13
00:00:27,179 --> 00:00:29,496
The record tells us what really happened.
